  "notes": [
    "The gateway is local-only for Qwen model weights: it never silently downloads a missing model during generation. Use the explicit model installer or place a complete snapshot under Neo_Runtime/voice/models/qwen3_tts.",
    "Install state combines the verified isolated-runtime marker with a local snapshot probe (config plus complete weight set).",
    "Phase 4 exposes installed/runtime-ready Qwen3-TTS CustomVoice models in the normal Voice TTS selector.",
    "Base voice-clone and VoiceDesign models remain voice-ui-gated for later dedicated surface activation.",
    "Provider-control discovery is manifest-owned and does not require starting the Qwen worker."
  ]
